# The capability sheets are generated by crates/harness/src/capture/sheet.rs,
# which deliberately emits LF only (see that file's doc comment). This
# repository has no other .gitattributes and core.autocrlf converts on
# checkout, so without this line a Windows checkout of these files gains
# CRLF and an LF-emitting generator fails the golden test byte-for-byte on
# Windows while passing on Linux CI (which does no such conversion). Forcing
# `eol=lf` here keeps the working-tree bytes identical to what the generator
# writes, on every platform.
docs/providers/*.md text eol=lf
